  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Feta Pie.png|200px|left|Feta pie]]\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 34\n |price = 1 to 223\n |time = 1 h 30 m \n |source = {{Infoicon|pieo|bigger|link=Pie Oven}}\n |xp = 26\n |base = 62\n |time3 = 1 h 16 min\n |dia= 5\n}}\n\n'''Feta pies''' are [[products]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 34.\n\nLike all [[products]], they are stored in the [[barn]].\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Making feta pies'''===\n[[File:Pie Oven.png|150px|left|Pie Oven]]\nFeta pies are made in the [[Pie Oven]].\n\nTo make a pie, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Goat Cheese.png|75px|link=Goat Cheese|Goat cheese]]\n|[[File:Wheat.png|75px|link=Wheat|Wheat]]\n|[[File:Egg.png|75px|link=Egg|Egg]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 1 hour and 30 minutes to make a pie, and 1 hour and 16 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] oven. Each pie gives players 26 [[experience]] points.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Selling feta pies'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside Shop]]\n* Feta pie can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 2,232 {{Infoicon|coin}} for 10 pies.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a pie costs 183 {{Infoicon|coin}}.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders require 2 to 3 feta pies per crate, up to a total of 9 per boat.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Fetakuchen\n|es = Tarta de feta\n|fr = Quiche à La Feta\n|it = Torta di feta\n|nl = Fetataart\n|no = Fetapai\n|zh = Feta Pie\n}}\n[[pt-br:Torta de queijo]]\n[[ru:Пирог с фетой]]\n[[Category:Pie Oven Products]]\n[[Category:Wheat Products]]\n[[Category:Egg Products]]\n[[Category:Goat Cheese Products]]",
